      "text": "- Recipe name, recipe ID\n\n- Extract ingredient info\n(rice, apples, how many\ngrams, liters, etc.)\n\n-  Nutrient related features\n(calories, sodium content,\netc.)\n\n- Cooking instruction (time,\ntemperature, action, etc.)\n\n- Recipe introduction, if any\n(for query search task)\n\n- Statistic info in any\n(average rating, no. of\nreview, serving amount, etc.)\n\n- Tagging/category features\nif any\n\n- Retrieve recipe images\n\n...",
