      "originalText": "- Recipe name, recipe ID\n\n- Extract ingredient info (rice, apples, how many grams, liters, etc.)\n\n-  Nutrient related features (calories, sodium content, etc.)\n\n- Cooking instruction (time, temperature, action, etc.)\n\n- Recipe introduction, if any (for query search task)\n\n- Statistic info in any (average rating, no. of review, serving amount, etc.)\n\n- Tagging/category features if any\n\n- Retrieve recipe images\n\n...",
      "autoResize": true,
