      "text": "- Based on grocery datasets,\nextract only records related to\ncooking ingredient, this help us\nunderstand how people shopping\nand what ingredients they might\nhave at home\n\n- InstaCart Online Grocery\nBasket dataset has  good\nrecords of order_id and\nproduct_id, quatities related with\neach order\n\n...",
      "fontSize": 26.2916798942023,
      "fontFamily": 5,
