      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Image classification model that classify recipe name based on\ninput images. We should compare multiple models for evaluation,\nalso using pretrained models for comparison or fine-tuning is\nalso an option.\n\n- Further we can also explore food segmentation models where\nit can recognize the ingredients in the images, this information\ncan used to make recommendations on meal that have\ningredients close to the input images",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "AgBq5aBAcscu-BSmX6P9R",
      "originalText": "- Image classification model that classify recipe name based on input images. We should compare multiple models for evaluation, also using pretrained models for comparison or fine-tuning is also an option.\n\n- Further we can also explore food segmentation models where it can recognize the ingredients in the images, this information can used to make recommendations on meal that have ingredients close to the input images",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
