      "updated": 1772502236125,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- Require exploration and personal opinions about what information might be\nimportant to display to users on the web UI, it can be dataset statistics,\ninteresting finding, etc.\n\n- Notebooks related to EDA, model analysis, etc. should also have\nvisualizations for comparison, as we can use those in the technical report.\n\n\n- Recommended to create visualization with Plotly package so we can easily\nmigrate that to the Dash UI app\n\n...",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "z6Otj4WCI1_74kZBcjNww",
      "originalText": "\n- Require exploration and personal opinions about what information might be important to display to users on the web UI, it can be dataset statistics, interesting finding, etc.\n\n- Notebooks related to EDA, model analysis, etc. should also have visualizations for comparison, as we can use those in the technical report.\n\n\n- Recommended to create visualization with Plotly package so we can easily migrate that to the Dash UI app\n\n...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
