      "seed": 1338306380,
      "version": 1720,
      "versionNonce": 1148756424,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772502236125,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- We can create a custom metric to rank the\nrecommendation based on input criterias, or using\navailable ranking models such as LGBMRanker, LightFM\nand optimize ranking metric such as NDCG.\n\n- Need to figure about a good way so we can evaluate\nthe recommendations against an ideal ranking list if we\ndon't have a relevant rank list to compare with. This\nis a problem with offline evaluation\n\n...",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "Ig7RZE45ZxScXo_-UCoU0",
      "originalText": "\n- We can create a custom metric to rank the recommendation based on input criterias, or using available ranking models such as LGBMRanker, LightFM\nand optimize ranking metric such as NDCG.\n\n- Need to figure about a good way so we can evaluate the recommendations against an ideal ranking list if we don't have a relevant rank list to compare with. This is a problem with offline evaluation\n\n...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
