      ],
      "updated": 1772502236125,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "umSvt7dwqMmYxlVW2ubk4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11671.632986099003,
      "y": -4168.632669769771,
      "width": 746.28369140625,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1490882468,
      "version": 2423,
      "versionNonce": 2006840008,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772502236125,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- To generate a list of candidates, we can use a\ncombination of inverted-index postings, content-based\nfiltering, and collaboration filtering to create a subset\nof recipes (50-150) as candidate to present to the\nuser.\n\n- We will need to add in user bias (preferences) to the\ncandidate generation step to create the most\nreasonable list of recipes\n\n- Change a couple ingredient in the recipe if the user\nrequire substitute ingredient, or we want to change\ningredients to something healthier\n\n- Figure out how to address cold start problem, how\nmany recommendations we need to get a good\nconfident level. \n... \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vK2_aBadNr8RRNug5ysUe",
      "originalText": "\n- To generate a list of candidates, we can use a combination of inverted-index postings, content-based filtering, and collaboration filtering to create a subset of recipes (50-150) as candidate to present to the user.\n\n- We will need to add in user bias (preferences) to the candidate generation step to create the most reasonable list of recipes\n\n- Change a couple ingredient in the recipe if the user require substitute ingredient, or we want to change ingredients to something healthier\n\n- Figure out how to address cold start problem, how many recommendations we need to get a good confident level. \n... \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
